Commit: b647a8d5fcdb48cc27eba6d1b30d3305fd1546b3
Fetched: 2026-08-21

  lite_api.tl   the liteserver protocol, plus the builtins and the
                tonNode/adnl types it depends on
  ton_api.tl    the full node protocol; only the pub.* and tcp.* slices are
                compiled, which is what ADNL over TCP needs

These are the input to tools/tlgen, which derives constructor identifiers
from the schema text. Updating a schema therefore changes identifiers, so
re-run the generator and inspect the diff rather than assuming it is inert:

  dune build @runtest        # fails if the committed output is stale
  dune promote               # accept the regenerated files
